<rml>
<head>
    <title>Ingnomia</title>
    <link type="text/rcss" href="/styles/base.rcss" />
    <link type="text/rcss" href="/styles/components.rcss" />
    <link type="text/rcss" href="/screens/win98_classic.rcss" />
    <link type="text/rcss" href="/screens/shell.rcss" />
    <link type="text/rcss" href="/styles/accessibility.rcss" />
</head>
<body class="l-shell-screen l-shell-desktop">
  <!-- Main menu (Stage 18). The book has no title screen; the nearest documented form is a dialog box with its
       commands in one column, the default first (PDF p.169, p.346). Commands that need more input end in an
       ellipsis (PDF p.330-331). -->
  <section id="shell-main-dialog" class="w98-sheet l-shell-dialog l-main-menu-dialog" role="dialog" aria-labelledby="shell-title">
    <div class="w98-caption"><h1 id="shell-title" class="c-title-bar__title" data-l10n="win98.main_menu.title">Ingnomia</h1></div>
    <div class="w98-sheet__body">
      <p id="shell-presentation" class="w98-text" data-l10n="win98.main_menu.presentation">A settlement simulation. Carve a home beneath the mountain and guide a living settlement.</p>
      <p class="w98-text">Version <span id="shell-version"></span></p>
      <div class="w98-separator"></div>
      <nav id="shell-main-actions" class="w98-col">
        <div class="w98-line l-menu-row"><button id="shell-continue" class="w98-button l-menu-command" disabled="disabled" tab-index="-1" data-l10n="win98.main_menu.continue">Continue</button><p id="shell-continue-reason" class="w98-text w98-grow"></p></div>
        <div class="w98-line l-menu-row"><button id="shell-load" class="w98-button l-menu-command" data-l10n="win98.main_menu.load">Load Game...</button><p class="w98-text w98-grow" data-l10n="win98.main_menu.opens_a_saved_kingdom">Opens a saved kingdom.</p></div>
        <div class="w98-separator"></div>
        <div class="w98-line l-menu-row"><button id="shell-tutorial" class="w98-button l-menu-command" data-l10n="win98.main_menu.tutorial">Tutorial</button><p class="w98-text w98-grow" data-l10n="win98.main_menu.starts_a_guided_first_settlement">Starts a guided first settlement: gather, dig, store, craft, farm and shelter.</p></div>
        <div class="w98-line l-menu-row"><button id="shell-new-default" class="w98-button l-menu-command" data-l10n="win98.main_menu.new_default">Quick Start</button><p class="w98-text w98-grow" data-l10n="win98.main_menu.starts_a_new_kingdom_with">Starts a new kingdom with the recommended settings.</p></div>
        <div class="w98-line l-menu-row"><button id="shell-new-setup" class="w98-button l-menu-command" data-l10n="win98.main_menu.new_setup">Custom Game...</button><p class="w98-text w98-grow" data-l10n="win98.main_menu.chooses_the_world_and_the">Chooses the world and the starting settlement first.</p></div>
        <div class="w98-separator"></div>
        <div class="w98-line l-menu-row"><button id="shell-settings" class="w98-button l-menu-command" data-l10n="win98.main_menu.settings">Settings</button><p class="w98-text w98-grow" data-l10n="win98.main_menu.changes_display_interface_camera_sound">Changes display, interface, camera, sound and saving.</p></div>
        <div class="w98-line l-menu-row"><button id="shell-exit" class="w98-button l-menu-command" data-l10n="win98.main_menu.exit">Exit</button><p class="w98-text w98-grow" data-l10n="win98.main_menu.closes_ingnomia">Closes Ingnomia.</p></div>
      </nav>
      <p id="shell-action-error" class="w98-text l-shell-error u-hidden">The command could not be completed. <span id="shell-action-error-detail"></span></p>
    </div>
  </section>
</body>
</rml>
